<title>HONG KONG: China Light first interim div HK$0.34.</title>
<headline>China Light first interim div HK$0.34.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>First interim Div (H.K. cents) 34.0  vs 32.0</p>
<p>    Turnover			     4,735 vs 4,062</p>
<p>    Company name			 China Light and Power Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close			  February 14</p>
<p>    Dividend payable		   March 14</p>
<p>NOTE - China Light and Power is engaged in the generation and supply of electricity in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
